message: "If you use this software, please cite it using this metadata."
title: "RavelMathPub"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Ravel"
  - name: "AM"
abstract: >-
  Authored by Ravel; coordinated and architected by AM. A research and
  computation library for Pisot substitutions, Rauzy fractals,
  contact-boundary graphs, exact algebraic arithmetic, adelic methods,
  and selected experiments around the Spectre aperiodic monotile.
